<title>JAPAN: Nissan Jan domestic output up 10.0% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Nissan Jan domestic output up 10.0% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Thursday its domestic production in January rose 10.0 percent from a year earlier to 139,589 vehicles.</p>
<p>It was the first gain in six months on year-on-year basis.</p>
<p>Nissan said its January exports rose 11.8 percent year-on-year to 53,123 vehicles, marking the fifth straight month of gains on a year-on-year basis.</p>
</text>
